  "Header": "UNT-SOA-V1.0",
  "Group": "Acquisition",
  "Category": "Media",
  "Description": "Speech Object Acquisition: acquires Speech Objects from the real world and provides them, and the Scene Descriptors of what it acquires where the Data Type exists. A microphone gives a Basic Speech Object; a source on a disk or a network may give a Basic or a full Speech Object, and Basic or full Scene Descriptors. The end of the Speech Object is the end of the speech.",
